  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"w squared plus 12 w minus 40 equals 0\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>12</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>40</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>0</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following is a solution to the given equation?</p>",
